${release_readiness}See the [`prepare-release` job documentation](https://repomatic.net/workflows#github-workflows-changelog-yaml-jobs) for details. Merging this pull request triggers the [release pipeline](https://repomatic.net/workflows#github-workflows-release-yaml-jobs):

1. Creation of a `v$version` tag on `main` branch
2. Build and release of the Python package to [PyPI](https://pypi.org)
3. Compilation of the project's binaries
4. Publication of a GitHub `v$version` release with all artifacts above attached

## How-to release `v$version`

${dev_release_review}${changes_review}1. **Click `Ready for review`** below
1. **Click `Rebase and merge`** below

> [!CAUTION]
> Do not `Squash and merge`: the release needs the [2 distinct commits](https://github.com/kdeldycke/repomatic/blob/main/docs/workflows.md#freeze-and-unfreeze-commits) in this PR.
